# MetroBI visual locations

- **MetroMap/** — Leaflet map visual (WMS, GeoJSON, shapefile)
- **MetroKit/** — xeokit 3D model viewer (XKT, glTF, IFC, NavCube)

Run `pbiviz` from the visual's own folder. Model and tile URLs need `WebAccess`.
